    "content": "Ég vil nota Halcon en ég er ekki viss um hvaða staðla myndavélin(ar) mín styðja Venjulega munu framleiðendur nefna hvaða staðla þeir styðja með skýrum hætti annaðhvort í skjölun eða ef skjöl eða markaðsefni innihalda USB3 Vision, GigE Vision eða GenICam merki.\nHere’s an example from Basler: https://www.baslerweb.com/en/products/cameras/area-scan-cameras/scout/sca640-120gc/\nUsually camera manufactures will mention what standards their products conform to, in the below example you can see it supports GenICam and GigE Vision, which is what we want.\nYou can also find more information here:\nDoes your camera support USB3 Vision?\nDoes your camera support GigE Vision?\nLast updated: 2024-06-03 | View on official support site",
