    "content": "Uppsetning Swing Catalyst getur stundum mistekist vegna ófullnægjandi heimilda Vandamál: Swing Catalyst uppsetningarforritið getur stundum mistekist vegna ófullnægjandi heimilda.\nÞekkt tilvik hafa verið þar sem Swing Catalyst uppsetningarforritið mistekst við að búa til Driver möppuna, eins og sýnt er á þessari skjámynd:\nSuggested solution Try running the installer as administrator (right click Run As Administrator).\nClose all other active programs \u0026 re-run the installer.\nMake sure all other users are signed out of the computer. Disable file sharing for the installation directory folder and check the administrator privileges. Restart the computer.\nIf you are still having issues please try to follow the steps shown in this article:\nhttps://knowledge.ni.com/KnowledgeArticleDetails?id=kA00Z000000P9c0SAC\nIf none of this works, please contact support, our support site\nLast updated: 2023-12-19 | View on official support site",
